This license covers my own work in this repository: Kiosk and WAWIS
(1991-1995) and what I added in 2026 (the reconstructed units in lib/, the
tools, the documentation and screenshots). It does not cover:

- kiosk/FIELDS.PAS (from version 1.2B on): a Turbo Pascal 6.0 Turbo Vision
  demo unit, (c) 1990 Borland International, with additions of mine.
- wawis/SWINPRN.PAS: Borland's simplified Windows printer unit,
  (c) 1991-92 Borland International.
- wawis/CTL3D.PAS: a unit for Microsoft's CTL3D.DLL, (c) 1994 c't 11/94,
  Heiko Stuckenberg.
- wawis/BTPWIN.PAS and wawis/BTRIEVE.INC: adapted from BTP, the Btrieve
  unit for Turbo Pascal, (c) 1993 John C. Leon.
- docs/play/js-dos: an unmodified excerpt of js-dos 8.5.3 by Alexander
  Guryanov, GPL-2.0 (see docs/play/js-dos/NOTICE.md and COPYING there).
- docs/play/kiosk12c.jsdos contains KIOSK.EXE, built with Turbo Pascal 6.0,
  so it includes Borland's run-time library and Turbo Vision.
- The business data kept with the programs (kiosk/TEST, wawis/DATEN,
  wawis/BESTELL, wawis/OS): records of Norkus & Blaaß and the Quickbox
  kiosks, not software, published here in a pseudonymised form.

These remain with their owners. The names Quickbox and Norkus & Blaaß, the
Quickbox logo (wawis/QUICKBOX.BMP) and the product names in the data and
screenshots belong to their respective owners.
